IdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/pbvn9d","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/fzymq1","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/cjghr5","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/omerjv","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/okhyzb","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/idrsyu","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/xwmphk","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/t9yfls","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/jb9ek8","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/aku6xq","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/n2kajt","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/pmrhqk","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"},{"relationType":"HasPart","relatedIdentifier":"10.57745/vmphwk","relatedIdentifierType":"DOI"}],"relatedItems":[],"sizes":[],"formats":[],"version":null,"rightsList":[],"descriptions":[{"description":"Abstract The dataset gives a comprehensive data collection focusing on the ageing of twenty 18650 Graphite/LFP 1.1 Ah commercial cells in first and second life. The ageing from a pristine state up to 40 % of capacity loss is uncommon due to the extensive testing time required. Therefore, this new data collection provides insights on long-term ageing of lithium-ion batteries. The initial aim of the study was to comprehend the aging in first and second-life applications, with a special focus on the sudden acceleration of capacity loss that can occur after a long-term use. The ageing experiment was designed to assess the impact of various test conditions: electric vehicle use, high current charge and discharge, full or partial discharge and a reduced operating voltage window. The cells were characterised every 100 cycles to measure the remaining capacity and the pseudo-open-circuit-voltage. This dataset can help the research community in studying second-life applications or any other study on long-term ageing of Graphite/LFP batteries: new diagnosis and prognosis techniques, AI, battery modelling, and more. Data description For more information about the experiment and the dataset, please refer to the open-access data paper : Wheeler, W., Bultel, Y., Venet, P. et al. An ageing study of twenty 18650 lithium-ion Graphite/LFP cells in first and second life use. Sci Data 12, 392 (2025). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41597-025-04712-7.","descriptionType":"Abstract"}],"geoLocations":[],"fundingReferences":[],"xml":"","url":"https://entrepot.recherche.data.gouv.fr/citation?persistentId=doi:10.57745/OLBXKT","contentUrl":null,"metadataVersion":2,"schemaVersion":"http://datacite.org/schema/kernel-4","source":"mds","isActive":true,"state":"findable","reason":null,"viewCount":5410,"viewsOverTime":[{"yearMonth":"2025-02","total":16},{"yearMonth":"2025-03","total":115},{"yearMonth":"2025-04","total":173},{"yearMonth":"2025-05","total":168},{"yearMonth":"2025-06","total":201},{"yearMonth":"2025-07","total":176},{"yearMonth":"2025-08","total":126},{"yearMonth":"2025-09","total":73},{"yearMonth":"2025-10","total":171},{"yearMonth":"2025-11","total":268},{"yearMonth":"2025-12","total":223},{"yearMonth":"2026-01","total":287},{"yearMonth":"2026-02","total":200},{"yearMonth":"2026-03","total":454},{"yearMonth":"2026-04","total":405},{"yearMonth":"2026-05","total":379},{"yearMonth":"2026-06","total":347},{"yearMonth":"2026-07","total":545},{"yearMonth":"2026-08","total":873},{"yearMonth":"2026-09","total":210}],"downloadCount":1368,"downloadsOverTime":[{"yearMonth":"2025-03","total":46},{"yearMonth":"2025-04","total":